<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ACCL - Maintenance Mode</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/list_icon.png" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://googleapis.com/css2?family=Lexend+Deca:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Lexend Deca', sans-serif;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 550px;
            background: #242424;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border: 1px solid #333333;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #999999;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .badge {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: #cccccc;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .btn-discord {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background-color: #5865F2;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 6px;
            transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
        }

        .btn-discord:hover {
            background-color: #4752c4;
        }

        .btn-discord img {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            margin-right: 8px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="badge">Status Update</div>
        <h1>Challenge List is Down</h1>
        <p>The Ayaan Chicken Challenge List is currently down for maintenance. Updates are being applied to the data layout, configuration files, and framework settings. The interface will be back online shortly with all leaderboards and records intact.</p>
        
        <!-- Replace the '#' with your permanent Discord invite link -->
        <a href="#" class="btn-discord" target="_blank">
            <img src="/assets/discord.svg" onerror="this.style.display='none'" alt="">
            Discord Server
        </a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>

